From: CB1 native transport work
Subject: [PATCH] Validate requested static HDR EOTF and expose accepted output depth

Independent changes against the matched NVIDIA MIT/GPL-2.0 native source.
No Hades implementation, helper, comment, test or patch is imported.
The live depth property is read-only through rejected setters, rather than
IMMUTABLE (which bypasses atomic_get_property in DRM).

